OL,5,AQuestions
OL,6,
OL,7,FFinance Minister Elin Jones is
OL,8,Fannouncing the Welsh government's first
OL,9,Fdraft budget under Plaid Cymru
OL,11,FDetails of the tax and spending plans
OL,12,Fshow an extra #500m for the NHS, but
OL,13,Fother public services could still feel
OL,14,Fthe pinch
OL,16,FEarlier Rhun ap Iorwerth called Reform
OL,17,FUK's boycott of the Senedd a
OL,18,F"dereliction of duty" during First
OL,19,FMinister's Questions
